  "lines": [
    { "key": "n1", "gap": 0.5, "text": "People think the best engineers were just born smarter." },
    { "key": "n2", "gap": 0.5, "text": "But look at how they actually learned." },
    { "key": "n3", "gap": 0.45, "text": "They went deep. They read the papers everyone else skipped." },
    { "key": "n4", "gap": 0.45, "text": "They rebuilt systems from scratch, until they knew why things break." },
    { "key": "n5", "gap": 0.45, "text": "They argued at whiteboards, and shared what they found." },
    { "key": "n6", "gap": 0.5, "text": "It took them years." },
    { "key": "n7", "gap": 1.35, "text": "Meet Arjun." },
    { "key": "n8", "gap": 0.5, "text": "He's a good engineer. But he wants to be a great one." },
    { "key": "n9", "gap": 0.45, "text": "He saves every roadmap. Watches tutorials at two x. Follows every AI launch." },
    { "key": "n10", "gap": 0.5, "text": "But when the interviewer says: design a rate limiter..." },
    { "key": "n11", "gap": 0.25, "text": "he freezes." },
    { "key": "n12", "gap": 0.9, "text": "Skillmaxing changes that." }
  ],

